  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research program UTENRIKS - Asia in a Time of Change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asia in a Time of Change is one of three sub-activities in the research program UTENRIKS (Research on international relations, foreign and security policy and Norwegian interests), managed by the Research Council of Norway. The purpose of the activity is to produce high-quality knowledge that will contribute to economic growth and welfare in Asian developing countries.</narrative>
  </description>
